{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07432","headline":"谪官後卧病官舍简贺兰侍郎 · 刘长卿","name":"谪官後卧病官舍简贺兰侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青春衣绣共称宜，白首垂丝恨不遗。\n江上几回今夜月，镜中无复少年时。\n生还北阙谁相引，老向南邦衆所悲。\n岁岁任他芳草绿，长沙未有定归期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07432.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07432","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}